# Drop training screenshots and recordings in this folder.
#
# Each media slot in the training pages tells you the exact filename to use,
# e.g. `website-w2-edit-headline.mp4`. Save the file here with that name, then
# uncomment the matching embed line in the page.
#
# A file saved here as `foo.png` is referenced in the docs as `/starfish-training/foo.png`.
#
# To remove the whole training book after the session:
#   1. delete docs/starfish-training/
#   2. delete docs/public/starfish-training/
#   3. (optional) revert the withMermaid wrapper in .vitepress/config.mts back to
#      defineConfig, then: npm uninstall mermaid vitepress-plugin-mermaid
